      slug: "ghana-house-floor-plans-2026",
      excerpt: "The right floor plan can save you 15-25% on construction costs. The most efficient layouts for 2, 3, 4, and 5-bedroom houses.",
      content: `<p>Your floor plan determines your construction cost more than any other design decision. Here are the most cost-effective layouts for every house size.</p><h2>2-Bedroom: Compact Rectangle (80-100 SQM)</h2><p>Simple rectangular design with shared bathroom between bedrooms. Minimal corridor space. Estimated build cost: GHS 250,000–400,000.</p><h2>3-Bedroom: L-Shaped (120-150 SQM)</h2><p>Separates master bedroom from other rooms. Efficient use of space. Cost savings: 15% vs complex designs. Estimated build cost: GHS 400,000–650,000.</p><h2>4-Bedroom: Courtyard Design (180-220 SQM)</h2><p>Rooms arranged around a central courtyard. Excellent ventilation, reduced corridor space. Estimated build cost: GHS 600,000–1,200,000.</p><h2>5-Bedroom: Two-Story (250-350 SQM)</h2><p>Vertical design saves land and foundation costs per square meter. Estimated build cost: GHS 900,000–2,000,000+.</p><p>Get a cost estimate for your preferred floor plan with our free calculator.</p>`,
